OL,8,G0306 Outlook
OL,9,     FWhen Zayd Ayers Dohrn's parents
OL,10,     Fgave themselves up, many of their
OL,11,     Fformer revolutionary comrades did
OL,12,     Fnot. This was to be a big problem
OL,13,     Ffor Zayd's family.
OL,14,G0350 Witness History
OL,15,     FIn 2007, an abandoned photo album
OL,16,     Frevealed the chilling normality of
OL,17,     Flife at the Nazi concentration
OL,18,     Fcamp, Auschwitz. Among those
OL,19,     Fpictured is Josef Mengele, the
OL,20,     FAngel of Death.
